<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6049] Incorrect Calculation of `expressionMd5` Value When Saving Computable Columns</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6049</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When saving a computable column, the `expressionMd5` value in the JSON does not match the `expressionMd5` value on the table.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13609043">KYLIN-6049</key>
            <summary>Incorrect Calculation of `expressionMd5` Value When Saving Computable Columns</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
